<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Welcome to Sabeel</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .header {
            background: #27ae60;
            color: white;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            border-radius: 5px 5px 0 0;
        }
        .content {
            background: #f9f9f9;
            padding: 30px;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            border-top: none;
        }
        .welcome-message {
            background: #e8f5e8;
            border-left: 4px solid #27ae60;
            padding: 15px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .unique-id {
            background: #3498db;
            color: white;
            padding: 10px;
            text-align: center;
            border-radius: 5px;
            font-family: monospace;
            font-size: 16px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .footer {
            background: #ecf0f1;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            border-top: none;
            border-radius: 0 0 5px 5px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #7f8c8d;
        }
        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #27ae60;
            color: white;
            padding: 12px 30px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="header">
        <h1>Sabeel</h1>
        <p>Welcome to Your Journey</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="content">
        <h2>Welcome {{firstName}}!</h2>
        
        <div class="welcome-message">
            <p>Thank you for registering with Sabeel! Your account has been created successfully and you're now ready to begin your spiritual journey.</p>
        </div>
        
        <p>Your unique identifier is:</p>
        <div class="unique-id">
            {{uniqueIdentifier}}
        </div>
        
        <h3>What's Next?</h3>
        <ul>
            <li>Complete your profile information</li>
            <li>Switch between Pèlerin and Accompagnant roles</li>
            <li>Join our community of travelers</li>
        </ul>
        
        <p>Your default role is <strong>Pèlerin</strong>, but you can switch to <strong>Accompagnant</strong> at any time.</p>
        
        <a href="#" class="btn">Complete Your Profile</a>
        
        <p>If you have any questions, please don't hesitate to contact our support team.</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="footer">
        <p>&copy; 2026 Sabeel. All rights reserved.</p>
        <p>This is an automated message, please do not reply to this email.</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
